// BT-5270: a class whose class side overrides `doesNotUnderstand:args:`. It
// answers neither the collection messages nor `to:do:`, so the pure send reaches
// the override. An inlined writing fold or counted loop would raise
// `does_not_understand` instead, so it raises `stateful_block_dispatch`.

Object subclass: Bt5270ClassDnuProxy

  class doesNotUnderstand: selector args: _arguments => selector
